msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the blackjack table. You can play one game for\r\n"
"as little as 10 chips. Care to try your luck?"
msgstr ""
"Benvenuto al tavolo del blackjack. Puoi giocare una partita per soli 10 "
"fiches. Vuoi tentare la fortuna?"

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"You're good. I bet you play blackjack pretty often. How about playing the "
"house, one-on-one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "What would you like to do now?"
msgstr "Cosa vuoi fare adesso?"

msgctxt "352"
msgid "All right, then. I'll need your 1,000 chips first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "You paid 1,000 chips."
msgstr "Hai pagato 1.000 chip."

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Thank you. Now, then, let's begin."
msgstr "Grazie. Bene, allora, iniziamo."

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Very well. Then let's continue with normal blackjack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "I'm feeling lucky today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "An excellent choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Non adesso."

msgctxt "484"
msgid "I see. We hope you'll play next time."
msgstr "Capisco. Speriamo che giocherai la prossima volta."

msgctxt "496"
msgid "You seem to be short on chips. Please come back soon."
msgstr "Mi sa che sei a corto di fiches. Fatti rivedere presto."

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Run the rules by me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"This is a game between you and the house. Whoever gets\r\n"
"three wins first wins the game."
msgstr ""
"Questa è una partita tra te e il banco. Il primo che arriva a tre vittorie "
"vince la partita."

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Before the game begins, I'll need 1,000 chips. The payout\r\n"
"differs depending on which deck is used."
msgstr ""
"Prima che la partita inizi, mi serviranno 1.000 fiches per farti unire. La "
"vincita varia a seconda del mazzo utilizzato."

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"- Normal deck: 2,000-chip payout\r\n"
"- Deck without 2, 3, or 4 cards: 2,500-chip payout\r\n"
"- Deck without 7, 8, or 9 cards: 2,000-chip payout\r\n"
"- Deck without J, Q, or K cards: 4,000-chip payout"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "If you win, you'll get the designated number of chips."
msgstr ""

